    new "I followed Evelyn up the marble staircase toward the second-floor corridor."

    old "Di sepanjang koridor panjang berpenerangan lampu minyak temaram, deretan potret leluhur keluarga Rosewood tergantung di dinding kayu ek yang gelap."
    new "Along the lengthy corridor lit by dim oil lamps, rows of ancestral Rosewood portraits hung upon the dark oak walls."

    old "Ketika kami melewati persimpangan menuju tangga lantai tiga, langkah kakiku sempat tertahan."
