    new "Only old memories that refuse to depart, sir. And old memories in this house have the unfortunate habit of demanding a most grievous price from anyone who awakens them."

    old "Jawaban Evelyn diucapkan dengan nada datar dan dingin, tanpa sedikit pun keraguan atau ketakutan."
    new "Evelyn's answer was delivered in a flat, cold tone, without the slightest trace of hesitation or fear."

    old "Evelyn membukakan pintu kayu jati berukir mawar di ujung lorong lantai dua."
