    old "{i}...Guest... Mengapa kau datang begitu terlambat?...{/i}"
    new "{i}...Guest... Why have you come so terribly late?...{/i}"

    old "Darahku terasa membeku sejenak di dalam dada."
    new "My blood seemed to freeze for an instant within my chest."

    old "Aturan kedua terlintas jelas di benakku: {i}Jangan pernah menjawab suara yang memanggil namamu dari taman mawar.{/i}"
    new "The second rule flashed clearly through my mind: {i}Never answer a voice that calls your name from the rose garden.{/i}"

