    new "Beneath the warm crimson velvet coverlet, I gazed up at the ceiling and the shadowed canopy posts, illuminated by the dim glow of the hearth's dying embers."

    old "Malam pertama di Rose Manor akhirnya berlalu dalam keheningan yang sarat misteri."
    new "The first night at Rose Manor passed at last in a silence laden with mystery."

    old "Namun satu hal yang kupahami dengan pasti: tujuh malam di mansion ini akan menjadi pertaruhan antara kebenaran masa lalu dan keselamatan nyawaku sendiri."
    new "Yet of one thing I was certain: seven nights in this mansion would become a wager between the truth of the past and the safety of my very life."

